{"content_hash": "13d68c09281e8210", "version_id": 185, "article_id": 19, "level_code": "en_c1", "lang": "en", "level": 5, "level_label": "C1 高级", "title": "Arteta Becomes Premier League's Best-Paid Manager on £20m-a-Year Deal", "title_zh": "阿尔特塔年薪2000万镑续约，成英超最贵主帅", "topic": "sports", "source": "skysports", "source_url": "https://www.skysports.com/football/news/12040/13596325/arsenal-manager-mikel-arteta-becomes-premier-leagues-highest-paid-boss-on-20m-a-year-new-contract-paper-talk", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://e2.365dm.com/26/08/1920x1080/skysports-paper-talk-football_7317647.jpg?20260809160824", "credit": ""}, "published_date": "2026-10-07", "word_count": 251, "reading_minutes": 1.3, "lead": "Arsenal's Mikel Arteta has signed a new contract worth a reported £20m a year, making him the highest-paid manager in the Premier League. Meanwhile, Liverpool are eyeing another big-money attacker, and Thomas Tuchel insists England are moving on without Cole Palmer.", "lead_zh": "阿森纳主帅米克尔·阿尔特塔签下新合同，据悉年薪高达2000万英镑，一举成为英超收入最高的主教练。与此同时，利物浦正考虑再签一名高价攻击手，而图赫尔则强调英格兰队没有帕尔默照样前行。", "preview": "Mikel Arteta has put pen to paper on a new deal reportedly worth £20m a year, a figure that propels him to the summit of Premier League mana", "preview_zh": "据《每日邮报》报道，米克尔·阿尔特塔已签下一份年薪据称高达2000万英镑的新合同，这一数字将他推上英超主帅收入的榜首。这份协议彰显了阿森纳对这位西班牙教头的坚定信任——在他执教北伦敦球队期间，球队已重新跻身争冠行列。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 175, "url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@d7bba21/content/audio/19/en_c1.mp3", "duration": 99.525, "size_bytes": 600912, "engine": "edge-tts", "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural", "word_count": 280, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@d7bba21/content/data/versions/185.json", "paragraphs": ["Mikel Arteta has put pen to paper on a new deal reportedly worth £20m a year, a figure that propels him to the summit of Premier League managerial earnings, according to the Daily Mail. The agreement underscores Arsenal's determination to keep faith with the Spaniard, whose side have re-established themselves as title contenders during his tenure in north London.", "Not content with their already formidable attacking options, Liverpool are said to be weighing up yet another blockbuster acquisition, the Daily Star reports. Such a move would further swell a forward line that has already absorbed substantial investment, signalling the club's continued willingness to spend big in pursuit of silverware.", "Elsewhere, Thomas Tuchel has declared that the \"train is rolling\" without Cole Palmer, after England impressed during their Nations League camp in the midfielder's absence. The Evening Standard suggests the manager is comfortable with his squad's depth, even when a player of Palmer's calibre is unavailable.", "In other developments, Kieran McKenna has secured a role as a UEFA technical observer, just months after departing Ipswich, while Gianluigi Donnarumma's agent has disclosed that Manchester City offered reassurances following the club's recent guilty verdict. Former Premier League midfielder Cheikhou Kouyate, meanwhile, has revealed he secretly battled a heart condition throughout his career.", "Away from the English game, Lionel Messi was curiously handed both a yellow and a red card by the referee officiating his final Argentina appearance, and Rwanda appears poised to beat South Africa to host a permanent Formula 1 return to Africa."], "paragraphs_zh": ["据《每日邮报》报道，米克尔·阿尔特塔已签下一份年薪据称高达2000万英镑的新合同，这一数字将他推上英超主帅收入的榜首。这份协议彰显了阿森纳对这位西班牙教头的坚定信任——在他执教北伦敦球队期间，球队已重新跻身争冠行列。", "据《每日星报》报道，利物浦并不满足于现有强大的攻击线，正考虑再完成一笔重磅引援。此举将进一步壮大本就投入巨资打造的前场阵容，表明俱乐部为争夺冠军仍愿大手笔花钱。", "另一边，图赫尔宣称，在帕尔默缺阵的情况下，英格兰队在欧国联集训期间表现出色，“列车仍在行驶”。《标准晚报》认为，即便缺少帕尔默这样的球员，这位主帅对球队的阵容深度依然充满信心。", "其他方面，基兰·麦肯纳在离开伊普斯维奇仅数月后，便获得了欧足联技术观察员一职；多纳鲁马的经纪人透露，在曼城近期被判有罪后，俱乐部已向球员作出安抚。与此同时，前英超中场库亚特承认，自己整个职业生涯都在秘密对抗心脏病。", "在英格兰足坛之外，梅西在代表阿根廷出战的最后一场比赛中，离奇地被主裁判出示了黄牌和红牌；而卢旺达似乎有望击败南非，成为F1永久重返非洲的举办地。"], "body": "Mikel Arteta has put pen to paper on a new deal reportedly worth £20m a year, a figure that propels him to the summit of Premier League managerial earnings, according to the Daily Mail. The agreement underscores Arsenal's determination to keep faith with the Spaniard, whose side have re-established themselves as title contenders during his tenure in north London.\n\nNot content with their already formidable attacking options, Liverpool are said to be weighing up yet another blockbuster acquisition, the Daily Star reports. Such a move would further swell a forward line that has already absorbed substantial investment, signalling the club's continued willingness to spend big in pursuit of silverware.\n\nElsewhere, Thomas Tuchel has declared that the \"train is rolling\" without Cole Palmer, after England impressed during their Nations League camp in the midfielder's absence. The Evening Standard suggests the manager is comfortable with his squad's depth, even when a player of Palmer's calibre is unavailable.\n\nIn other developments, Kieran McKenna has secured a role as a UEFA technical observer, just months after departing Ipswich, while Gianluigi Donnarumma's agent has disclosed that Manchester City offered reassurances following the club's recent guilty verdict. Former Premier League midfielder Cheikhou Kouyate, meanwhile, has revealed he secretly battled a heart condition throughout his career.\n\nAway from the English game, Lionel Messi was curiously handed both a yellow and a red card by the referee officiating his final Argentina appearance, and Rwanda appears poised to beat South Africa to host a permanent Formula 1 return to Africa.", "body_zh": "据《每日邮报》报道，米克尔·阿尔特塔已签下一份年薪据称高达2000万英镑的新合同，这一数字将他推上英超主帅收入的榜首。这份协议彰显了阿森纳对这位西班牙教头的坚定信任——在他执教北伦敦球队期间，球队已重新跻身争冠行列。\n\n据《每日星报》报道，利物浦并不满足于现有强大的攻击线，正考虑再完成一笔重磅引援。此举将进一步壮大本就投入巨资打造的前场阵容，表明俱乐部为争夺冠军仍愿大手笔花钱。\n\n另一边，图赫尔宣称，在帕尔默缺阵的情况下，英格兰队在欧国联集训期间表现出色，“列车仍在行驶”。《标准晚报》认为，即便缺少帕尔默这样的球员，这位主帅对球队的阵容深度依然充满信心。\n\n其他方面，基兰·麦肯纳在离开伊普斯维奇仅数月后，便获得了欧足联技术观察员一职；多纳鲁马的经纪人透露，在曼城近期被判有罪后，俱乐部已向球员作出安抚。与此同时，前英超中场库亚特承认，自己整个职业生涯都在秘密对抗心脏病。\n\n在英格兰足坛之外，梅西在代表阿根廷出战的最后一场比赛中，离奇地被主裁判出示了黄牌和红牌；而卢旺达似乎有望击败南非，成为F1永久重返非洲的举办地。", "text": "Mikel Arteta has put pen to paper on a new deal reportedly worth £20m a year, a figure that propels him to the summit of Premier League managerial earnings, according to the Daily Mail. The agreement underscores Arsenal's determination to keep faith with the Spaniard, whose side have re-established themselves as title contenders during his tenure in north London. Not content with their already formidable attacking options, Liverpool are said to be weighing up yet another blockbuster acquisition, the Daily Star reports. Such a move would further swell a forward line that has already absorbed substantial investment, signalling the club's continued willingness to spend big in pursuit of silverware. Elsewhere, Thomas Tuchel has declared that the \"train is rolling\" without Cole Palmer, after England impressed during their Nations League camp in the midfielder's absence. The Evening Standard suggests the manager is comfortable with his squad's depth, even when a player of Palmer's calibre is unavailable. In other developments, Kieran McKenna has secured a role as a UEFA technical observer, just months after departing Ipswich, while Gianluigi Donnarumma's agent has disclosed that Manchester City offered reassurances following the club's recent guilty verdict. Former Premier League midfielder Cheikhou Kouyate, meanwhile, has revealed he secretly battled a heart condition throughout his career. Away from the English game, Lionel Messi was curiously handed both a yellow and a red card by the referee officiating his final Argentina appearance, and Rwanda appears poised to beat South Africa to host a permanent Formula 1 return to Africa.", "vocab": [{"word": "propel", "pos": "verb", "zh": "推动；使跃升", "note": "常与 to 连用，如 propel sb to the top"}, {"word": "underscore", "pos": "verb", "zh": "凸显；强调", "note": "新闻常用，比 emphasize 更书面"}, {"word": "tenure", "pos": "noun", "zh": "任期；任职期间", "note": "多指重要职位"}, {"word": "formidable", "pos": "adj", "zh": "强大的；令人敬畏的", "note": "可形容阵容、对手"}, {"word": "weigh up", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "权衡；考虑", "note": "weigh up an option/a signing"}, {"word": "blockbuster", "pos": "noun", "zh": "重磅之作；轰动性交易", "note": "此处指大手笔引援"}, {"word": "swell", "pos": "verb", "zh": "使增大；扩充", "note": "swell the ranks 扩充队伍"}, {"word": "silverware", "pos": "noun", "zh": "奖杯；锦标", "note": "体育报道中指冠军荣誉"}, {"word": "calibre", "pos": "noun", "zh": "水平；才能", "note": "英式拼写，美式为 caliber"}, {"word": "disclose", "pos": "verb", "zh": "透露；披露", "note": "比 reveal 更正式"}, {"word": "verdict", "pos": "noun", "zh": "裁决；判定", "note": "法律语境常用"}, {"word": "be poised to", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "准备就绪；即将", "note": "be poised to do sth"}, {"word": "officiate", "pos": "verb", "zh": "执法；担任裁判", "note": "指裁判主持比赛"}, {"word": "in sb's absence", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "在某人缺席期间", "note": "正式表达，常用于报道"}], "title_original": "Papers: Arteta becomes Premier League's highest-paid boss on £20m-a-year", "summary_original": "The top stories and transfer rumours from Wednesday's newspapers...", "body_original": "Arsenal manager Mikel Arteta becomes Premier League's highest-paid boss on £20m-a-year new contract - Paper Talk\nPlus: Liverpool weigh up another blockbuster signing to add to their mega money attacking line-up; Thomas Tuchel says the \"train is rolling\" without Cole Palmer after England impressed in his absence during the Nations League camp; Kieran McKenna lands UEFA job months after leaving Ipswich\nWednesday 7 October 2026 23:07, UK\nThe top stories and transfer rumours from Wednesday's newspapers...\nPREMIER LEAGUE\nMikel Arteta has become the Premier League's highest-paid boss on a £20m-a-year new contract -\nDaily Mail\nLiverpool are weighing up another blockbuster signing to add to their mega money attacking line-up -\nDaily Star\nTransfer Centre LIVE!\n|\nLatest on YOUR PL club!\nGot Sky?\nWatch LIVE football on your phone\n📱\nNot got Sky?\nGet Sky Sports\nor\ns